OL,3,A'It's been amazing' - Owain Wyn Evans
OL,4,Acompletes four-nation Children in Need
OL,5,Aride
OL,6,
OL,7,FRadio presenter Owain Wyn Evans has
OL,8,Fcompleted his challenge of cycling
OL,9,Fthrough all four UK nations to raise
OL,10,Fmoney for BBC Children in Need.
OL,12,FThe Welsh host of BBC Radio 2's Early
OL,13,FBreakfast Show rode almost 400 miles,
OL,14,Fsetting off from Glasgow and finishing
OL,15,Fin Cardiff on Friday.
OL,17,FThe challenge started on 9 November in
OL,18,FScotland and over the next five days,
OL,19,FOwain rode through Northern Ireland,
OL,20,FEngland and Wales and raised #3,853,530
OL,21,Fin the process.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
